{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09229","headline":"答令狐侍郎 · 韦应物","name":"答令狐侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一凶廼一吉，一是复一非。\n孰能逃斯理，亮在识其微。\n三黜故无愠，高贤当庶几。\n但以亲交恋，音容邈难希。\n况昔别离久，俱忻藩守归。\n朝宴方陪厕，山川又乖违。\n吴门冒海雾，峡路凌连矶。\n同会在京国，相望涕沾衣。\n明时重英才，当复列彤闱。\n白玉虽尘垢，拂拭还光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}